    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the established residential area of Knocknaganny Park, this three-bedroom mid-terrace home enjoys a convenient location within easy reach of Sligo town centre and a range of local amenities. The property is well positioned for access to schools, shops, recreational facilities and public transport links, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families or investors. Upon entering, you are welcomed by a comfortable living room featuring laminate wood flooring and a feature fireplace. Continuing through the property, the kitchen and dining area offers a fitted kitchen with ample storage units, tiled flooring and a separate dining space, providing a practical setting for everyday living and entertaining. A guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation. On the first floor, there are three bedrooms, two of which are double rooms with built-in wardrobes, while the third is a single bedroom, also benefiting from built-in storage. The main bathroom is fully tiled and incorporates a bath, separate mains shower and the usual sanitary fittings. There is also convenient access to the bathroom from the main bedroom. Externally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front, while at the rear there is a private garden, offering a pleasant outdoor space. Local amenities include Sligo town center, Sligo University Hospital, ATU Sligo, local schools, shops and recreational facilities. The property also benefits from convenient access to the N4 and N15 road networks, with public transport connections available nearby. To make an enquiry please contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nLiving Room (4.54m x 3.55m)\r\nLaminate wood floor, Feature fireplace, TV Point.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining area (5.45m x 3.58m)\r\nFitted kitchen with ample storage units, Tiled floor and between units to kitchen, Laminate wood floor to dining area, TV Point.\r\n\r\nWC (1.85m x 0.76m)\r\nTiled floor, WC, WHB.\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.75m x 3.30m)\r\nDouble room, Laminate wood floor, Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.77m x 2.31m)\r\nDouble room, Carpet floor, Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (2.50m x 2.31m)\r\nSingle room, Carpet floor, Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.55m x 2.04m)\r\nTiled floor and wet areas, Bath, Separate mains shower, WC, WHB. Door to bedroom 1.\r\n\r\nHot-press"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "PVC Double glazed windows and doors.\r\nElectric storage heating.\r\nGeneros electrical spec.\r\nRegency 6 panel doors.\r\nShed to rear.\r\nOff-street parking on tarmac driveway.\r\nNearby all essential amenities such as Cosgrove’s Centra, Maugheraboy Post office, several primary and secondary schools and local sports facilities.\r\nJust over 1 Kilometer to Sligo Town Center and Sligo Bus and Train station."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      }
    ],
